    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "负数的除法和正数除法的意义相同：就是已知两个因数的积和其中的一个因数，求另一个因数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0123#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "负数的除法和正数除法的意义相同：就是已知两个因数的积和其中的一个因数，求另一个因数.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，$-12$除以$-4$，就是求数$x$，使$-4\\cdot x=-12$.因为$-4\\cdot3=-12$，所以另一个因数等于3.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0123#10",
        "p0124#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "例如，$-12$除以$-4$，就是求数$x$，使$-4\\cdot x=-12$.因为$-4\\cdot3=-12$，所以另一个因数等于3.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$-12$是被除数，$-4$是除数，而3就是商.因为$|3|=|-12|:|-4|$，所以被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值就可以求出商的绝对值.负数$-12$除以负数$-4$，就得到商是正数3.于是，$-12:(-4)=3$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$-12$是被除数，$-4$是除数，而3就是商.因为$|3|=|-12|:|-4|$，所以被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值就可以求出商的绝对值.负数$-12$除以负数$-4$，就得到商是正数3.于是，$-12:(-4)=3$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两个负数相除，商是正数.商的绝对值等于被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "两个负数相除，商是正数.商的绝对值等于被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$4\\cdot(-3)=-12$，所以$-12$和4的商等于$-3$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为$4\\cdot(-3)=-12$，所以$-12$和4的商等于$-3$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "异号二数相除，商是负数.商的绝对值等于被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "异号二数相除，商是负数.商的绝对值等于被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1.$-81$除以$-2.7$.两个负数相除，商是正数，被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值：\n$81:2.7=30$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "例1.$-81$除以$-2.7$.两个负数相除，商是正数，被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值：$81:2.7=30$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "即$-81:(-2.7)=30$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "即$-81:(-2.7)=30$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用乘法检验结果：\n$-2.7\\cdot30=-81$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "用乘法检验结果：$-2.7\\cdot30=-81$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2.$-4.5$除以9.异号两数相除，商是负数.被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值：\n$4.5:9=0.5$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "例2.$-4.5$除以9.异号两数相除，商是负数.被除数的绝对值除以除数的绝对值：$4.5:9=0.5$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "即$-4.5:9=-0.5$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "即$-4.5:9=-0.5$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用乘法检验证实，除法运算是正确的：\n$9\\cdot(-0.5)=-4.5$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "用乘法检验证实，除法运算是正确的：$9\\cdot(-0.5)=-4.5$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "零除以任何一个不等于零的数都得零.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "零除以任何一个不等于零的数都得零.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "零不能作除数（图112）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0124#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "零不能作除数（图112）.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
